#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:87
#: 4bca8203c0f54ea1882c97ca17a47680
msgid "2. 切片序列数据"
msgstr "2\\. Sliced Sequence Data"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:89
#: 6fdfe7678dcb419cb25b0f6666d33ead
msgid ""
"深度学习知识追踪模型通常无法直接处理极长的不规则序列（如数千步交互）。UniKT 会根据 `max_seq_len` "
"将每个长序列切分为固定预算的子序列："
msgstr ""
"Deep Knowledge Tracing models typically cannot process arbitrarily long "
"ragged sequences. UniKT slices lengthy histories into sub-sequences "
"within `max_seq_len` budgets:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:91
#: eea528e9ad414799ab9b8d31dc84f672
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`{dataset}_split_question_sequence.parquet`**：用于题目级模型（如 "
"SimpleKTQ、AKT、DKT 等面向题目的实现）。一行对应一次题目交互，`skills` 保留为 `List(Int32)`。"
msgstr ""
"**`{dataset}_split_question_sequence.parquet`**: For question-level "
"models (e.g., SimpleKTQ, AKT, item-centric DKT). Each row corresponds to "
"a question attempt, preserving `skills` as `List(Int32)`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:92
#: 773a87894ee2403bab715d7ab5ff2b6a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`{dataset}_split_skill_sequence.parquet`**：用于技能级模型（如 DKT、DKVMN、GKT "
"等面向技能概念的模型）。若一道题关联多个技能，管线会在此表中展开为多行，并将 `skill` 投影为单值 `Int32`。"
msgstr ""
"**`{dataset}_split_skill_sequence.parquet`**: For skill-level models "
"(e.g., DKT, DKVMN, GKT). Multi-skill questions are expanded into multiple"
" rows with `skill` projected to scalar `Int32`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:94
#: 2f989e88be564852bb48c4c972dc9831
msgid "切片表特有字段："
msgstr "Fields Unique to Sliced Tables:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md c70695241ac449f8834322c8e87e1df5
msgid "`sequence_id`"
msgstr "`sequence_id`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 138c82c4622e4cc5a6b2782a0e142747
msgid "切片子序列的全局唯一标识符"
msgstr "Globally unique sliced sequence identifier"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 419f90eca3a043cfab176dd579b7ffba
msgid "`seq_pos`"
msgstr "`seq_pos`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md f8de92915e584a289d58e512ce58bb33
msgid "该交互在当前子序列中的相对索引，从 `0` 到 `split_len - 1`"
msgstr ""
"Relative interaction index within current slice, from `0` to `split_len -"
" 1`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md a0ed03dc82f64c4188aec83e11e908fb
msgid "继承自对应学生的 `fold` 标签，确保切片后划分依然严谨对齐"
msgstr "Inherited `fold` label from student, ensuring leak-free partitioning"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:102
#: 2e94c28873234c348c01c7a1f0674377
msgid "3. 实体关系表"
msgstr "3\\. Entity Relation Tables"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:104
#: a253ffa1b87b42308745322fcf46f93b
msgid "用于构建图神经网络拓扑结构（如 GIKT, SGKT, HDHKT）或 Q 矩阵。最核心的关系表为 `question_skill`："
msgstr ""
"Used for constructing GNN graph topologies (e.g., GIKT, SGKT, HDHKT) or "
"Q-matrices. The primary relation table is `question_skill`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 44df634fc0cc4f6e9c8223964770d899
msgid "题目标识"
msgstr "Question identifier"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 3991b7649c58493a9670c981466ae8b4
msgid "`skill`"
msgstr "`skill`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md bab85e5451e1451d95a219e02f93ed87
msgid "关联的技能概念标识"
msgstr "Associated skill concept identifier"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:113
#: 933644b2add145268c081f860e207611
msgid "序列截断与展开策略"
msgstr "Sequence Truncation and Expansion Strategies"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:115
#: 4a8ad3de2fc94ee7b271f919a039d029
msgid ""
"知识追踪领域的一大经典技术难点在于：**多技能题目在转换为技能序列时，截断应发生在 KC 展开前还是展开后？** UniKT 通过 "
"`--data.truncation_stage` 提供了显式控制："
msgstr ""
"A classic technical nuance in knowledge tracing is: **should multi-skill "
"items be truncated before or after skill expansion?** UniKT provides "
"explicit control via `--data.truncation_stage`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:117
#: cde0e7ecd82e4f3fb6b2f3002032a062
msgid "**`post_expansion`（默认，推荐）**："
msgstr "**`post_expansion` (Default, Recommended)**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:118
#: a667ce0b70464db3b3d5722c0665b81c
msgid "先对单次题目的多个技能进行行展开，然后再按 `max_seq_len` 进行切块截断。"
msgstr ""
"Expands multi-skill questions into separate rows first, then truncates "
"blocks by `max_seq_len`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:119
#: 695f97eda3a04e0cae4b535dc820a061
msgid ""
"**特点**：保证每个子序列中的技能行数绝对不超过 "
"`max_seq_len`，张量对齐简单；但在极少数情况下，同一道题关联的多个技能可能会被边界切开在两个相邻子序列中。"
msgstr ""
"**Characteristics**: Guarantees skill row count in each sub-sequence "
"never exceeds `max_seq_len`, simplifying tensor padding; rarely, skills "
"belonging to one question might split across slice boundaries."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:120
#: 1f45b9fc8d06439d9ecfb99cd4e5896e
msgid "**`pre_expansion`**："
msgstr "**`pre_expansion`**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:121
#: 09d2a3de625847bba9bd897abc94ea8d
msgid "先对题目的交互事件进行截断切块（每块最多 `max_seq_len` 次答题），再在块内展开技能。"
msgstr ""
"Truncates question interaction events into chunks first (at most "
"`max_seq_len` attempts per chunk), then expands skills within each chunk."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:122
#: ad64d88e748048b4925d69e803be0529
msgid ""
"**特点**：保证同一道题的所有技能永远处于同一个子序列内；展开后的实际行数可能略大于 `max_seq_len`，框架运行时会自动根据 "
"`metadata.json` 中记录的真实最大长度动态适配张量。"
msgstr ""
"**Characteristics**: Ensures all skills of a question remain in the same "
"sub-sequence; expanded row counts may slightly exceed `max_seq_len`, "
"which the framework dynamically accommodates via the actual maximum "
"length in `metadata.json`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:126
#: d1388b7a39f642d9b62b5983bd95c52f
msgid "数据集采样策略"
msgstr "Dataset Sampling Strategies"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:128
#: 63221d1a8feb45bab437736e1af3f624
msgid "对于超大规模数据集（如 EdNet 或 Junyi），UniKT 提供了内置采样逻辑，在不破坏统计分布的前提下加速原型开发："
msgstr ""
"For ultra-large datasets (such as EdNet or Junyi), UniKT provides built-"
"in sampling to accelerate prototyping without perturbing statistical "
"distributions:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:130
#: 22381a36271c4291b70d5ee95edd9bd0
msgid ""
"# 1. 绝对数量采样：随机抽取 1,000 名学生及其全部答题历史\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 --data.sample_size 1000 "
"--data.sample_strategy random\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 比例采样：抽取 10% 的学生\n"
"python data_process.py process -d ednet_kt1 --data.sample_ratio 0.1\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 分层采样：按作答量与答对率分箱保持分布一致性\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_size 5000 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_strategy stratified \\\n"
"    --data.sample_attempts_bins [20, 100, 500] \\\n"
"    --data.sample_correct_bins [0.3, 0.7]\n"
msgstr ""
"# 1. Absolute count sampling: randomly draw 1,000 students and their full"
" interaction histories\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 --data.sample_size 1000 "
"--data.sample_strategy random\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Ratio sampling: draw 10% of students\n"
"python data_process.py process -d ednet_kt1 --data.sample_ratio 0.1\n"
"\n"
"# 3. Stratified sampling: bin by attempts and accuracy to preserve "
"distributions\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_size 5000 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_strategy stratified \\\n"
"    --data.sample_attempts_bins [20, 100, 500] \\\n"
"    --data.sample_correct_bins [0.3, 0.7]\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:147
#: b13654b0fb60487e9d47322772c07b07
